Subject: Keep generator bytecode outside the immutable prepared source

Upstream-base: 1155e0ed531126f33a1279afa029349651ca1c93

The JSON generators import pinned Jinja2/MarkupSafe and local helpers while
configuring and building. Python bytecode caches beside those sources invalidate
the prepared-source content manifest. Disable bytecode writes for these invocations;
retain all generated C++/header outputs under Dawn's binary directory.

--- a/generator/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/generator/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -63,6 +63,7 @@
     # Build the set of args common to all invocation of that generator.
     set(BASE_ARGS
         ${Python3_EXECUTABLE}
+        -B
         ${arg_SCRIPT}
         --template-dir
         "${DAWN_TEMPLATE_DIR}"
